'''Grave''' is a [[Common Weapons|common]] knife that was originally obtainable by unboxing it from the [[2018 Halloween Box|Halloween Box]] during the [[Halloween Event 2018|2018 Halloween Event]]. It is now only obtainable through trading as the event has since ended.

== Appearance ==
Its blade is stone gray with the acronym "RIP" imprinted on it, resembling a grave, hence the name. Imprinted on the heel of the blade is a small patch of green grass. The guard is light green, and the handle is solid black.

== Trivia ==
* It has a [[Grave (Gun)|partner gun]] under the same name, making the [https://murder-mystery-2.fandom.com/wiki/Murder_Mystery_2_Wiki:Wiki-Bot/Grave_Set Grave Set].

